{"from":"3:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"MAL.3.1\">1</ref> Of the messenger, majesty, and grace of Christ.<br/><ref to=\"MAL.3.7\">7</ref> Of the rebellion,<br/><ref to=\"MAL.3.8\">8</ref> sacrilege,<br/><ref to=\"MAL.3.13\">13</ref> and infidelity of the people.<br/><ref to=\"MAL.3.16\">16</ref> The promise of blessing to them that fear God.<br/><br/><br/>I will.<br/><ref to=\"MAL.2.7 MAL.4.5 MAT.11.10 MAT.11.11 MRK.1.2 MRK.1.3 LUK.1.76 LUK.7.26-LUK.7.28 JHN.1.6 JHN.1.7\">2:7; 4:5; Mt 11:10,11; Mr 1:2,3; Lu 1:76; 7:26-28; Joh 1:6,7</ref><br/>and he.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.40.3-ISA.40.5 MAT.3.1-MAT.3.3 MAT.17.10-MAT.17.13 LUK.1.16 LUK.1.17 LUK.3.3-LUK.3.6\">Isa 40:3-5; Mt 3:1-3; 17:10-13; Lu 1:16,17; 3:3-6</ref><br/><ref to=\"JHN.1.15-JHN.1.23 JHN.1.33 JHN.1.34 JHN.3.28-JHN.3.30 ACT.13.24 ACT.13.25 ACT.19.4\">Joh 1:15-23,33,34; 3:28-30; Ac 13:24,25; 19:4</ref><br/>and.<br/><ref to=\"PSA.110.1 ISA.7.14 ISA.9.6 HAG.2.7-HAG.2.9 LUK.2.11 LUK.2.21-LUK.2.32 LUK.2.38 LUK.2.46\">Ps 110:1; Isa 7:14; 9:6; Hag 2:7-9; Lu 2:11,21-32,38,46</ref><br/><ref to=\"LUK.7.19 LUK.7.20 LUK.19.47 JHN.2.14-JHN.2.16\">Lu 7:19,20; 19:47; Joh 2:14-16</ref><br/>even.<br/><ref to=\"GEN.48.15 GEN.48.16 EXO.23.20 ISA.63.9 HOS.12.3-HOS.12.5 ACT.7.38\">Ge 48:15,16; Ex 23:20; Isa 63:9; Ho 12:3-5; Ac 7:38</ref><br/>he shall come.<br/><ref to=\"HAG.2.7\">Hag 2:7</ref></p>"}
