{"from":"4:6","body":"<p>turn.<br/><ref to=\"LUK.1.16 LUK.1.17 LUK.1.76\">Lu 1:16,17,76</ref><br/>lest.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.61.2 DAN.9.26 DAN.9.27 ZEC.11.6 ZEC.13.8 ZEC.14.2 MAT.22.7 MAT.23.35-MAT.23.38\">Isa 61:2; Da 9:26,27; Zec 11:6; 13:8; 14:2; Mt 22:7; 23:35-38</ref><br/><ref to=\"MAT.24.27-MAT.24.30 MRK.13.14-MRK.13.26 LUK.19.41-LUK.19.44 LUK.21.22-LUK.21.27\">Mt 24:27-30; Mr 13:14-26; Lu 19:41-44; 21:22-27</ref><br/>and smite.<br/><ref to=\"DEU.29.19-DEU.29.29 ISA.24.6 ISA.43.28 ISA.65.15 DAN.9.11 ZEC.5.3 ZEC.14.12\">De 29:19-29; Isa 24:6; 43:28; 65:15; Da 9:11; Zec 5:3; 14:12</ref><br/><ref to=\"MRK.11.21 HEB.6.8 HEB.10.26-HEB.10.31 REV.22.3 REV.22.20 REV.22.21\">Mr 11:21; Heb 6:8; 10:26-31; Re 22:3,20,21</ref></p>"}
